{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "A no-mail challenge lets the hero take items from Postmaster, Recruit-A-Friend reward and Customer Support mail but not from a player or other server mail (#11186, #11404)",
  "contract": [
    "Report #11186: under Hardcore the hero cannot take items from Postmaster mail or Recruit-A-Friend reward mail;",
    "the take fails with \"Your challenge forbids receiving mail.\" #11404 asks the same for Customer Support mail.",
    "Expected: Postmaster, Recruit-A-Friend reward and Customer Support mail, like the Elite Warchest (#10678), are",
    "server or staff gifts and not player-to-player mail. Under Bloodbath (challenge 15, NO_MAIL) CMSG_MAIL_TAKE_ITEM",
    "answers MAIL_OK (0) for a Silverleaf from the Postmaster, a Mageroyal from a Recruit-A-Friend reward mail, a",
    "Briarthorn a game master sends with .send items and a Swiftthistle sent with .send items from the console, and",
    "the items land in the bags, while a Peacebloom mailed by another character and an Earthroot in other",
    "sender-less GM-stationery mail (boss loot, item recovery) stay refused with MAIL_ERR_INTERNAL_ERROR (6)."
  ],
  "timeout_ms": 90000,
